  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the given data we have,&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f523aafe-bc8f-4fab-9cfc-298454c2cf28-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 171px;\" /></p><p>Now by diagram, Slope of tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Slope of line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AP</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>On solving we get&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
